{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "ede74a73ee2a2060d98481799555ab46310ee999058078afc35feee3bb9758f7", "ja": "しんろうさ～ん♪　しんぷさ～ん♪\nすえな～がく～♪　おっしあわせに～♪", "zh": "新郎～♪新娘～♪\n幸福～美满～♪直到永远～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "de93392a5fa36fa06ae50877821f3802c8dfd2334ffdfd49009cbbc078bad508", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nちょっと相談に乗ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n可以和你商量一件事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5d204d6b7fb74dad722ef96b9c84ee1014834ee9e56bf190fafcbb4eb0d6564", "ja": "なんだか楽しそうだな。幸せな相談事か？", "zh": "你看起来真开心，是要商量什么好事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "834a3a96a5a0af239741170304b1b3bfa046b0f5209ecb4f1476141eef5dba64", "ja": "はい♪　今度、いとこのお姉さんの結婚式で、私が\nお祝いの歌を歌わせてもらえることになったんです～♪", "zh": "是的♪其实我表姊邀请我\n去她的婚礼上唱歌祝福～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1004_p", "source_sha256": "38f6e1f69a3c084344f7dac4df2d8c56c92bc527420e2bbd9fb9a1e42b717685", "ja": "おおっ、よかったじゃないか！\nあ、さっきの歌は、その練習で？", "zh": "喔喔！那样很好啊！\n啊，你刚才就是在练习那首歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "a7d885cdc6c3bb1e8de5a359401911b1148330d9f3646a1d83c7c821db5c176e", "ja": "えっ、さっきの歌、そんなに上手でした？\nえへへ～、でも違いま～す！", "zh": "咦？我刚刚唱得有那么好听吗？\n嘿嘿～可惜不是～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "42373040c7f2ea63ab59cb32a6999070afb0966c5f863bc6729ef4a91146cfa0", "ja": "じつはまだ、どんな歌を歌おうか迷ってて。\nそれを相談したいんです！", "zh": "其实我还在犹豫要选哪一首歌。\n所以才想找你商量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "b20c3ce86516965531671a57c5a7f989800788fb6efc1415219c2896e88d195a", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、結婚式で\n歌ってもらえてうれしい歌とか、ありますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你知道在婚礼上唱什么歌，\n才能让大家都开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a1e1e19d376faeed54544e55999641ff8c45fcffbdd0053592fdbf340f1c00e6", "ja": "難しい質問だな……。うーん、俺だったら、\n歌に気持ちがこもってたら、なんでも嬉しいけど……。", "zh": "这问题还真困难……唔──\n我觉得只要唱的人有心，唱什么歌我都开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4edbcb3891ec0badbf91bb3069c8fdf0c7316b5f87707e017de6bb0f021a0aee", "ja": "でも、そうだな。可奈のことだから、そのお姉さんとの\n思い出の歌とか、あったりするんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过，我想想……可奈的话，有没有什么歌\n能代表你和那位表姊之间的回忆呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "1a00b9ef28cb6f0c029638c5dcf8ded066b5645031afe1c342439185e34fa165", "ja": "はっ！　あります！\n小さい頃に、お姉ちゃんが教えてくれた歌！", "zh": "啊！有耶！\n小时候，姊姊常常教我唱一首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "94f4416107ecb48921787aa0b663e4ae8d8aeaeb64434fd58ca140d656423ef9", "ja": "私がなかなか覚えられなくて、お姉ちゃん、いっぱい\n歌ってくれたんです。いつも、やさしくしてくれて……", "zh": "可是我一直记不起来，\n所以姊姊她唱了好多次给我听。她总是对我好温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "0d92ae23bc9ee7b5c8e7dc6bb9770c39a5e4963369f6ff99a3282673cbb0a7cb", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……。うう、おねえちゃんっ！\n私、がんばって歌うね！　えっと、えっと……！", "zh": "姊姊……呜呜，姊姊！\n我会努力唱歌的！我想想、我想想……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "fbb8c03946558878defe84f244e3c2706120c41013f5a55f7df5223c7853db7c", "ja": "はう！　{$P$}さん、私、\nやっぱり覚えてなかったかも！　どうしましょう～！？", "zh": "啊呜！{$P$}先生，\n我好像还是记不起来！怎么办～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0063_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4be319f18cc10fa9b788d95b9d3f54da43690881cbdce19fd89bd75935a0a06a", "ja": "（その後、可奈にアルバムを持ってきてもらい、\nどうにか記憶をたぐりよせた。……頑張れよ、可奈！）", "zh": "（之后，我请可奈把专辑带来，\n总算是帮助她记起来了……加油啊，可奈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
